    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3132" root="بل" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُلْبُلَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A mug</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُوز</span>) <i>having a spout</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُلْبُل</span>) <i>by
the side of its head,</i> (M, K, TA,) <i>from which the
water pours forth:</i> (TA:) or <i>a ewer, as long as
it contains wine.</i> (Kull p. 102.)

